        "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center\">Terms &amp; Conditions</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Parties.</strong>\n  The \"Seller\" refers to [Seller Name], and the \"Buyer\" refers to [Buyer Name].\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Validity.</strong>\n  This quotation is valid for 14 days from the date of issuance.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Payment.</strong>\n  Payment is due within 30 days of the invoice date. Late payments may incur\n  penalties.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Delivery.</strong>\n  Delivery times are estimated at 2-4 weeks from order confirmation.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Cancellation.</strong>\n  Orders may be canceled within 48 hours of placement without penalty.\n  Cancellations after this period may incur fees.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Ownership.</strong>\n  Ownership of goods remains with Seller until full payment is received.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Warranty.</strong>\n  Products are covered by a 12 months warranty against defects in materials and\n  workmanship.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Returns.</strong>\n  Returns or exchanges are accepted within 14 days of receipt, subject to terms\n  outlined in our returns policy.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Variations.</strong>\n  Any changes to the quotation must be agreed upon in writing.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Liability.</strong>\n  Seller is not liable for damages occurring during transportation.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Governing Law.</strong>\n  This quotation shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws\n  of Seller jurisdiction.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Confidentiality.</strong>\n  Both parties agree to keep all information exchanged in relation to this\n  quotation confidential.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Intellectual Property.</strong>\n  All intellectual property rights related to the quotation and any associated\n  materials remain with Seller.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Force Majeure.</strong>\n  Neither party shall be liable for any failure to perform their obligations\n  under this quotation due to unforeseen circumstances beyond their control.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Indemnity.</strong>\n  The Buyer agrees to indemnify and hold Seller harmless from any claims arising\n  from the use of the products or services provided under this quotation.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>Notices.</strong>\n  Any notices or communications regarding this quotation shall be sent to the\n  addresses provided by each party.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n</p>\n",
